  "post_title": "Maravilloso concierto de David Maho's Band en Cafè Druida de Onda",
  "post_date": "2016-01-30 13:44:10",
  "post_name": "maravilloso-concierto-de-david-mahos-band-en-cafe-druida-de-onda",
